<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>内存优化 on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/</link><description>Recent content in 内存优化 on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:25:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Linux 内存优化：ZRAM 内存压缩原理与配置实践</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/zram-memory-optimization-linux/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/zram-memory-optimization-linux/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在低配 VPS 或嵌入式 Linux 环境中，依赖磁盘作为虚拟内存（SWAP）极易引发 swap thrashing，进而导致系统卡死。利用 Linux 内核的 ZRAM 机制在 RAM 中划分压缩块设备，能够以微秒级 CPU 解压开销换取近乎翻倍的可用内存容量。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>